{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">&amp;UNDEFINE preprocessor directive</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/308865","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">&amp;UNDEFINE preprocessor directive</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Undefines a compile-time constant (preprocessor name).</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive__syntax_GC151M2678938\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d416045e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive__idGDE1UL2661639\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>&amp;UNDEFINE <var class=\"keyword varname\">preprocessor-name</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">preprocessor-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The preprocessor name (compile-time constant) that you want\nto undefine. </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive__notes_GC151N2678944\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d416045e139\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">When you use the <code class=\"ph codeph\">&amp;UNDEFINE</code> directive, ABL warns you\n          if the name you want to undefine was not previously defined. </li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The <code class=\"ph codeph\">&amp;UNDEFINE</code> directive undefines the currently\n          active name. It also undefines named include file arguments. </li>\n        <li class=\"li\">To globally define the same name more than once, use this directive to\n          undefine the name before redefining it. If you do not undefine the global name before\n          redefining it, the compiler produces a warning message for non-globally (scoped) defined\n          names. For globally defined names, <code class=\"ph codeph\">&amp;UNDEFINE</code> is optional, but\n          recommended for code readability. If <code class=\"ph codeph\">&amp;UNDEFINE</code> is not used, the last\n            <code class=\"ph codeph\">&amp;GLOBAL-DEFINE</code> statement is used.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive__see-also_GC151O2678948\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d416045e172\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ampGLOBAL-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampGLOBAL-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\">&amp;GLOBAL-DEFINE preprocessor directive</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\">&amp;SCOPED-DEFINE preprocessor directive</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINED-preprocessor-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINED-preprocessor-function.html\">DEFINED preprocessor function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\">&amp;SCOPED-DEFINE preprocessor directive</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Multi-line-comments.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Multi-line-comments.html\">/* Multi-line comments */</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/308865","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":576,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"&UNDEFINE preprocessor directive","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html","type":"Manual"}